{"id":"urteil","lemma":"Urteil","pos":"noun","rank":1836,"glosses":["judgment (the preferred spelling in a legal context), verdict, sentence (court decision)","judgement, opinion, usually one given after detailed consideration"],"ipa":"/ˈʊʁtaɪ̯l/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cc/De-Urteil.ogg/De-Urteil.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Urteiles","plural":"Urteile"},"examples":[{"text":"Trauen Sie meinem Urteil?","en":"Do you trust my judgment?","words":[{"g":"to trust"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Das Urteil liegt vor.","en":"The verdict is in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390538","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"}]},{"text":"Traust du meinem Urteil?","en":"Do you trust my judgment?","words":[{"g":"to trust","l":"trauen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Traut ihr meinem Urteil?","en":"Do you trust my judgment?","words":[{"g":"to trust","l":"trauen"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Wir können uns auf sein Urteil verlassen.","en":"We can rely on his judgement.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"to leave, to abandon"}]}]}